受到男性读者的热烈支持。\n(Photo by Famitsu WaveDVD)","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":210,"review_flag":"AUX_SEQUENCE_SHIFT; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1069,"cn_text":"周刊Famitsu\n1986年以《Famicom通信》之名创刊，是每周四发售的综合游戏杂志。\n由KADOKAWA Game Linkage发行。\n从家用机游戏到游戏应用、街机、PC，广泛覆盖各类游戏资讯。\n※图片为2010年当时版本","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":235,"review_flag":"AUX_SEQUENCE_SHIFT; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1070,"cn_text":"小型轻量卡宾枪。\n装备烟雾榴弹发射器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1071,"cn_text":"小型轻量卡宾枪。\n装备霰弹枪。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1072,"cn_text":"小型轻量卡宾枪。\n装备榴弹发射器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1073,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n按<I=AIM>瞄准，按<I=ATK>开火。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=AIM> | <I=ATK>","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1074,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备烟雾榴弹发射器和激光瞄准器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1075,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备烟雾榴弹发射器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1076,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备榴弹发射器和激光瞄准器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1077,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备榴弹发射器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1078,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备霰弹枪和激光瞄准器。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"CONTROL_TOKEN_PRESERVED; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1079,"cn_text":"新型轻量突击步枪。\n装备霰弹枪。\n按<I=△>切换。","cn_control_tokens":"<I=△>","cn_utf8_byte